    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Okay, I see what you did there with adding the stuff about the \"ancient ones\" and the \"forgotten rituals\"—it definitely adds more weight. But to be honest, it feels a little bit like you're just tacking on extra phrases to the exact same sentences from the first version. Like, adding \"as the old gods' power seeps back into the world\" to the \"unraveling\" line is okay, but it's still basically the same structure.\n\nThe validator gave us a slightly better score, but we're still way under the threshold for a \"High Depth\" encounter. We really need to hit that higher word count to get the engine to flag this as a major quest. \n\nTry one more pass? I really need you to focus on the *details* of the lore to make it long enough. Instead of just hitting the same points again, maybe describe the actual feeling of the gods' presence or the visual way the trees are changing. Please, just make sure you aren't just looping the same thoughts or using repetitive filler; I need actual new narrative content to justify the length.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
